sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pengguna Teknisi atau Manager
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant PDF as PDF Generator
    participant Share as share_plus Plugin

    U->>App: Buka detail laporan lalu tap Unduh PDF
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/reports/{id}/pdf

    API->>DB: SELECT report, booking, inspection_items, photo_urls
    DB-->>API: Data laporan lengkap

    API->>PDF: GenerateReport dengan data lengkap
    PDF-->>API: PDF bytes

    API-->>App: 200 OK application/pdf
    App->>Share: Buka share sheet dengan file PDF
    Share-->>U: Pilihan simpan ke perangkat atau bagikan via WhatsApp atau Email
